{"overview":"در سرزمینی که جادو وجود ندارد؛ سرزمینی که قدرتمندان قوانین را می‌سازند و ضعیفان باید اطاعت کنند؛ سرزمینی پر از گنج‌های دل‌فریب و زیبایی، اما در عین حال پر از خطرات پیش‌بینی‌نشده. سه سال پیش، شیاو یان که توانایی‌هایی نشان داده بود که دهه‌ها کسی ندیده بود، ناگهان همه چیز را از دست داد: قدرتش، شهرتش و وعده‌اش به مادرش. چه جادویی باعث شد تمام قدرت‌هایش را از دست بدهد؟ و چرا نامزدش ناگهان ظاهر شد؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"In a land where no magic is present. A land where the strong make the rules and weak have to obey. A land filled with alluring treasures and beauty, yet also filled with unforeseen danger. Three years ago, Xiao Yan, who had shown talents none had seen in decades, suddenly lost everything. His powers, his reputation, and his promise to his mother. What sorcery has caused him to lose all of his powers? And why has his fiancee suddenly shown up?","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":23,"y":2017,"poster":"/bdBpPtd78zTLEpTlGL9RFEfp7Pz.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2017,"poster":"/16CXeIZ7dlyAukrbrUcvDOTmnMN.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2018,"poster":"/nu88hbTo8KcHrn3ILs0B7x45tB8.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":12,"y":2019,"poster":"/pDJbATQucJ2NipF2NvWs7lwq33s.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":24,"y":2021,"poster":"/laV1CTHKyxUKCavZOaIKOQkSozY.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":219,"y":2022,"poster":"/4w7z5Y8chYWTU1X6renGTxtjpwl.jpg"}],"episodes":279,"crew":["顾振华","陈百俊"],"crew_en":["Gu Zhenhua","陈百俊"],"countries":["CN"],"cast":[{"name":"不一","role":"萧炎 (voice)","photo":"/rC30srBjftYqkJgMi82XFe2kWs.jpg","en":"Bu Yi"},{"name":"刘雨轩","role":"药老 / 药尘 (voice)","photo":"","en":"Liu Yuxuan"},{"name":"陈奕雯","role":"萧熏儿 / 古熏儿(voice)","photo":"/muj3gVK2759u2X9GMYqfw2VTfiu.jpg","en":"Chen Yiwen"},{"name":"冯骏骅","role":"美杜莎 / 彩鳞(voice)","photo":"/xGx9YUyaOTDcvxHlu2CXq08FOW9.jpg","en":"Feng Junhua"},{"name":"文晓依","role":"紫妍 (voice)","photo":"/pztsEIp8rbXSBJfdcddBs6jyxFf.jpg","en":